        "Content": "FOR SALE BY PRIVATE TREATY\n48, PRIORY WALK, ST. RAPHAEL`S MANOR, CELBRIDGE, CO. KILDARE, W23 P868.\n\nOnline Bidding: https://teamlorraine.ie/property/48-priory-walk-st-raphaels-manor-celbridge-co-kildare-w23-p868/ \n\nNational and International Award-winning agent, Team Lorraine Mulligan of REMAX Results for 23 years, is delighted to present No. 48 Priory Walk, St. Raphael`s Manor, a beautifully maintained two-bedroom mid-terrace home located in one of Celbridge`s most established and sought-after residential developments. This bright and inviting property is presented in excellent condition throughout and offers a wonderful opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a home that is ready to move into while still offering scope to personalise and make it their own.\n\nSince purchasing the property in September 2022, the current owners have invested in a number of quality upgrades, ensuring the home is presented in excellent, move-in-ready condition. These improvements include new flooring throughout the sitting room and both upstairs bedrooms, the replacement of the original storage heaters with an efficient oil-fired central heating system and radiators, a new boiler and digital immersion installed in the hot press, a full internal repaint in fresh modern colours, and a brand-new carpet fitted to the stairs and landing. These thoughtful enhancements provide added comfort, efficiency, and peace of mind for the new owners.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed into a spacious and airy living room that enjoys an abundance of natural light, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The room is tastefully presented and features an attractive electric fireplace, providing a comfortable focal point for relaxing or entertaining. The kitchen is well laid out and fitted with a range of units, along with integrated appliances, offering both practicality and functionality for everyday living. A convenient understairs storage area provides valuable additional space, helping to keep the home neat and organised.\n\nUpstairs, the property boasts two well-proportioned bedrooms, both offering comfortable accommodation with plenty of room for personal touches. The family bathroom is well-maintained and serves the first floor.\n\nTo the front, the home benefits from a low-maintenance outdoor space with a patio area, ideal for those seeking easy-care living.\n\nNo. 48 Priory Walk enjoys an excellent location within the ever-popular St. Raphael`s Manor development, just a short distance from the heart of Celbridge Village. Residents benefit from an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, and local amenities, while the beautiful grounds of Castletown House and Parklands are nearby for leisurely walks and outdoor recreation. The area is exceptionally well connected, with easy access to the M4 motorway, regular bus services, and Hazelhatch Train Station, providing convenient links to Dublin City Centre.\n\nOffering bright, comfortable accommodation in a highly desirable location, No. 48 Priory Walk presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a home with broad appeal and outstanding potential.\n\n\nDon`t miss this opportunity to acquire this delightful residence with lots of potential in great location.\n\nTo organize a viewing or to place a bid on this property go to www.teamlorraine.ie or scan the QR code on the photograph section of this brochure.\n\nINTEREST IS SURE TO BE STRONG. PLEASE LOG ONTO OUR WEBSITE TO ARRANGE A VIEWING.\n"
      },
